I have great news to share, you've been selected as the winner of
this year's annual original Louis Andrada's artwork draw.

You've won: "[Artwork Title]" ([Year]), [Medium], [Size]

To arrange delivery, could you reply to this email with:

- Your full name
- Your shipping address
- A phone number (in case there's a delivery question)

Given this is an original piece, I'd genuinely love to hop on a quick
